{"id":"td-1903","category":"teardown","cover":"🔧","region":"global","publishedAt":"2024-08-05","tags":["拆解分析","特斯拉"],"title":{"zh":"【车灯拆解2408】特斯拉 新Model 3尾灯","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"前面我们拆了新款毛豆3的大灯(传送门上篇，下篇),今天我们一起来看看这尾灯的拆解，这真的是一款结构非常，非常简单的灯。\n\n一贯的简约，C形尾灯同L形大灯呼应，高度集成各项尾灯功能。","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"前面我们拆了新款毛豆3的大灯(传送门上篇，下篇),今天我们一起来看看这尾灯的拆解，这真的是一款结构非常，非常简单的灯。\n\n一贯的简约，C形尾灯同L形大灯呼应，高度集成各项尾灯功能。打开外透镜，\n\n打开后盖及饰件，\n\n这个半总成里集成了一个尾灯的所有功能，\n\n拆解其实没什么难度，但其紧凑的设计，还是让研发人员花了些时间的，\n\n全家福(除了透镜，小编给拆坏了……)\n\nC形灯板，\n\n下PCBA总成，散热块跟PCBA透过铆接跟胶进行贴合，\n\n主厚壁，用的PC料子，\n\n看看车灯线束，就这一根，\n\n极简，设计高度集成，这确实很特斯拉，大家觉得这款灯值多少钱啊。","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/dengjuchaijie/1903.html","author":""},"media":{"images":["https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/FmQNOLthmr6DSJ0Jx1nyx7RUBxFn.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/FjfER9oXHhzHCDrzsthwhU-cJVuU.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/FuEpU8SwHOb7_KhzzrrmKvq6F7ki.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/lod1kwsoY9JsUXN0yn0q-2OVxvdv.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/ljrao1RYgQMvjFyVa6Eo6FgMYx1I.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/FkfWI6n0Wb52IBfrRzrB7xGYjwvX.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/luhkcpVk8FiSs_K7O57jICqCpK_i.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/lhyGOnLBILnCwajg49cE3gi-LdVe.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/lieQ2POUtWZ5NjQod-qh2-KhDXIm.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/FkSelc3hpEw_nAfvzsNwiblNBCrZ.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/lnRIimpCLIBqUEewSk_rr-QR-FN7.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/lqDQfCKerNXpt0e4XsOQOdkVSWxI.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/lspeupAfX-iVjiJukVw-ZdvuUXeT.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240805/lrkEyxLrIPOIydnJBbMqomgFdMdH.png","https://cdn.deng